### metadata MD_C_PRODUCT_MAINTAIN_SRV
GET HFO100.dest/sap/opu/odata/sap/MD_C_PRODUCT_MAINTAIN_SRV/$metadata

### metadata API_PRODUCT_SRV
GET HFO100.dest/sap/opu/odata/sap/API_PRODUCT_SRV/$metadata

### metadata API_PLANT_SRV
GET HFO100.dest/sap/opu/odata/sap/API_PLANT_SRV/$metadata

### metadata API_CLFN_CLASS_SRV
GET HFO100.dest/sap/opu/odata/sap/API_CLFN_CLASS_SRV/$metadata

### metadata API_CLFN_CHARACTERISTIC_SRV
GET HFO100.dest/sap/opu/odata/sap/API_CLFN_CHARACTERISTIC_SRV/$metadata

### vendor
GET HFO100.dest/sap/opu/odata/sap/API_BUSINESS_PARTNER/A_BusinessPartner?$select=BusinessPartner,BusinessPartnerFullName&$filter=to_BusinessPartnerRole/BusinessPartnerRole eq 'FLVN01'

### vendor role
GET HFO100.dest/sap/opu/odata/sap/API_BUSINESS_PARTNER/A_BusinessPartnerRole?$top=10&$format=json&$filter=BusinessPartnerRole eq 'FLVN01'

### vendor supplier
GET HFO100.dest/sap/opu/odata/sap/API_BUSINESS_PARTNER/A_Supplier?$top=10&$format=json

### unit of measure
GET HFO100.dest/sap/opu/odata/sap/MD_C_PRODUCT_MAINTAIN_SRV/I_UnitOfMeasure?$top=50

### material nuevo
GET HFO100.dest/sap/opu/odata/sap/MD_C_PRODUCT_MAINTAIN_SRV/I_Product?$top=10&$format=json

### material viejo
GET HFO100.dest/sap/opu/odata/sap/API_PRODUCT_SRV/A_ProductDescription?$top=10&$format=json&$filter=ProductDescription eq 'TEST'

### API_CLFN_PRODUCT_CLASSIFICATION_SRV
GET HFO100.dest/sap/opu/odata/sap/API_CLFN_PRODUCT_CLASSIFICATION_SRV/$metadata

### safety stock
GET HFO100.dest/sap/opu/odata/sap/API_PRODUCT_SRV/A_ProductSupplyPlanning?$filter=SafetyStockQuantity ne 0.000&$format=json

### class charact
GET HFO100.dest/sap/opu/odata/sap/API_CLFN_CLASS_SRV/A_ClfnClassForKeyDate('14')/to_ClassCharacteristic?$format=json

### class charact
GET HFO100.dest/sap/opu/odata/sap/API_CLFN_CLASS_SRV/A_ClfnClassCharcForKeyDate?$format=json&$top=10

### charact value
GET HFO100.dest/sap/opu/odata/sap/API_CLFN_CHARACTERISTIC_SRV/A_ClfnCharcValueForKeyDate?$filter=CharcValue eq '100 TO 120'&$format=json&$top=10

### characteristic num
GET HFO100.dest/sap/opu/odata/sap/API_CLFN_CHARACTERISTIC_SRV/A_ClfnCharacteristicForKeyDate('9840')/to_CharacteristicValue?$format=json&$top=10

### characteristic curr
GET HFO100.dest/sap/opu/odata/sap/API_CLFN_CHARACTERISTIC_SRV/A_ClfnCharacteristicForKeyDate('9841')/to_CharacteristicValue?$format=json&$top=10

### characteristic test_1
GET HFO100.dest/sap/opu/odata/sap/API_CLFN_CHARACTERISTIC_SRV/A_ClfnCharacteristicForKeyDate('9840')?$format=json

### characteristic test_2
GET HFO100.dest/sap/opu/odata/sap/API_CLFN_CHARACTERISTIC_SRV/A_ClfnCharacteristicForKeyDate?$filter=Characteristic eq 'CLASS'&$format=json&$top=10

### characteristic test_2 description
GET HFO100.dest/sap/opu/odata/sap/API_CLFN_CHARACTERISTIC_SRV/A_ClfnCharcValueForKeyDate(CharcInternalID='9841',CharcValuePositionNumber='2')/to_CharcValueDesc?$format=json

### plant prduct
GET HFO100.dest/sap/opu/odata/sap/MD_C_PRODUCT_MAINTAIN_SRV/I_ProductByPlantVH?$top=10&$format=json

### prod group nuevo
GET HFO100.dest/sap/opu/odata/sap/MD_C_PRODUCT_MAINTAIN_SRV/$metadata

### prod group nuevo filtro
GET HFO100.dest/sap/opu/odata/sap/MD_C_PRODUCT_MAINTAIN_SRV/I_ProductGroup_2?$top=1&$filter=ProductGroup%20eq%20'ICT1001'&$select=ProductGroup,ProductGroup_Text

### product group viejo
GET HFO100.dest/sap/opu/odata/sap/API_PRODUCTGROUP_SRV/A_ProductGroup?$format=json

### vendor nuevo
GET HFO100.dest/sap/opu/odata/sap/MD_BUSINESSPARTNER_SRV/C_BusinessPartnerSupplier?$filter=substringof('FLVN01', Role) eq true&$format=json&$top=10

### class filter
GET HFO100.dest/sap/opu/odata/sap/API_CLFN_CLASS_SRV/A_ClfnClassForKeyDate?$select=ClassInternalID,ClassType,Class&$filter=(ClassType%20eq%20%27001%27)&$top=10

### characs
GET HFO100.dest/sap/opu/odata/sap/API_CLFN_CHARACTERISTIC_SRV/A_ClfnCharacteristicForKeyDate?$format=json&$top=10

### a product
GET HFO100.dest/sap/opu/odata/sap/API_PRODUCT_SRV/A_Product?$format=json&$top=10

### fetch token
# @name FetchToken
GET HFO100.dest/sap/opu/odata/sap/API_PRODUCT_SRV/$metadata
x-csrf-token: Fetch

### post product
POST HFO100.dest/sap/opu/odata/sap/API_PRODUCT_SRV/A_Product
x-csrf-token: {{FetchToken.response.headers.x-csrf-token}}
Content-Type: application/json

